  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025-2026 Europe prepositioning of products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">14 Red Cross and red Crescent National Societies have taken a joint initiative that includes stocks and virtual warehousing known as X-stock
3 National Societies are creating a similar Xstock platform in the Baltics</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A contribution of EUR 100,000 helps IFRC and Red Cross and Red Crescent National Societies:
Stock approximately 2,950 Family Hygiene kits, ensuring immediate support for around 14,750 people. The Fam- ily Hygiene Kits will made available on a needs basis to those affected by disasters in the Europe and Central Asian region, based on historical data most likely in Countries in Central and Eastern Europe; the Caucasus; Southern Europe; and the Balkans.
Preposition additional relief supplies based on evolving needs in 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the frequency and scale of crises continue to grow, ensuring adequate funding and emergency supplies ahead of disasters remains a major challenge. Preparedness for immediate response is more critical than ever.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stock approximately 2,950 Family Hygiene kits, ensuring immediate support for around 14,750 people. The Fam- ily Hygiene Kits will made available on a needs basis to those affected by disasters in the Europe and Central Asian region, based on historical data most likely in Countries in Central and Eastern Europe; the Caucasus; Southern Europe; and the Balkans.
Preposition additional relief supplies based on evolving needs in 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
